  "contentHtml": "<p>10월 지식샘터 특별 수업 강좌(과학)을 소개합니다. 수업 자료가 함께 학교에도 올려놨습니다. 참고하시고 수업을 들어보고 활용하고 싶은 마음이 계신 샘이 있으면 함께 했으면 감사하겠습니다. 저도 만들어놓고 수업을 해 봤지만 그래도 보완해야 할 점들이 있는 것 같더라구요.. 이 자리를 빌어서 선생님들의 조언도 좀 구하고자 합니다.<br><br>과학&#160;시뮬레이션으로&#160;에듀테크&#160;수업하기(feat.생성형&#160;AI)-2시간 <br><a href=\"https://educator.edunet.net/local/ubmooc/view.php?id=24160\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://educator.edunet.net/local/ubmooc/view.php?id=24160</a><br>2024-10-19(토)&#160;09:00 <br>1차시&#160;:&#160;(생성형&#160;AI&#160;활용)&#160;물순환&#160;시뮬레이션 <br>함께&#160;학교&#160;수업&#160;자료&#160;참고&#160;:&#160;<a href=\"https://www.togetherschool.go.kr/lectureShare/detailView?pstId=44191\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.togetherschool.go.kr/lectureShare/detailView?pstId=44191</a><br><br>2차시&#160;:&#160;(생성형&#160;AI&#160;활용)&#160;복사평형&#160;시뮬레이션 <br>함께&#160;학교&#160;수업&#160;자료&#160;참고1&#160;:&#160;<a href=\"https://www.togetherschool.go.kr/lectureShare/detailView?pstId=44205\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.togetherschool.go.kr/lectureShare/detailView?pstId=44205</a><br>함께&#160;학교&#160;수업&#160;자료&#160;참고2&#160;:&#160;<a href=\"https://www.togetherschool.go.kr/lectureShare/detailView?pstId=44206\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.togetherschool.go.kr/lectureShare/detailView?pstId=44206</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"https://www.togetherschool.go.kr/lectureShare/detailView?pstId=44206\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"www.togetherschool.go.kr\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.togetherschool.go.kr/lectureShare/detailView?pstId=44206\" data-og-url=\"https://www.togetherschool.go.kr/lectureShare/detailView?pstId=44206\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://www.togetherschool.go.kr/lectureShare/detailView?pstId=44